  "brain_first": "“先把否定词圈到刺眼；我要找的是那个‘不对/例外’。”",
  "sort_order": 1030,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1326
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "题干含大写或否定词：NOT, EXCEPT, incorrect,",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1327
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "least likely。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1328
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1329
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "反向题本质仍是细节核对，只是目标反过来。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1330
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “先把否定词圈到刺眼；我要找的是那个‘不对/例外’。”",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1331
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 基础学生最常见失分是做对了三项却选错方向。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1332
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1333
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 在题干的 NOT/EXCEPT 下划两条线。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1334
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 把四个选项逐项标成 T（原文支持）或 F（原文不支持/错误）。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1335
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 题目问 NOT → 选F；题目问 EXCEPT → 选那个不属于其余规则的。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1336
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 最后重新读题干一次再涂卡。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1337
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 圈题干人物/时间/地点/段落/核心名词/NOT；定位后在段边写题号；必要时写",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1338
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“证据→选项”。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1339
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1340
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· Which is NOT true? → 找错误项",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1341
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· All are mentioned EXCEPT → 找没提到项",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1342
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 四项都完成T/F标记，再按题干方向选择。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1343
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果某一项没找到证据，不要马上选；先确认它不是同义改写隐藏在别处。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1344
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1345
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "文章支持A/B/D，C与原文相反。题目问“Which is NOT true?”，必须选C。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1346
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1347
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 忘记NOT。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1348
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· “没看到原词”就当没提到。",
      "sourcePage": 48,
      "sourceIndex": 1349
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1350
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 我最终选的是错项还是对项？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1351
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 题干方向重新读了吗？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1352
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： R-L 定位错｜R-P 同义替换错｜R-I 过度推",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1353
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "断｜R-S 范围/程度偷换｜R-N NOT/EXCEPT漏看｜R-M 主旨范围错。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1354
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1355
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 反向题：先圈NOT，再做T/F。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1356
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1358
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. 题干出现NOT，第一动作？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1359
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. 三项能在原文证实，一项不能，NOT题选？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1360
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. EXCEPT 与普通题方向相同吗？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1361
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. 做完反向题最重要复查？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1362
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 能否凭印象做NOT题？",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1363
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. 把NOT圈/框出来。；2. 不能被证实/与原文不符的一项。；3. 相反。；4. 我选的是“错误/例外”而不",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1364
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "是“正确”。；5. 不建议，逐项对原文。",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1365
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— R16 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“R16”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 49,
      "sourceIndex": 1366
    }
  ],
